graph TB
    subgraph Sidecar["llm-d-routing-sidecar (Go Reverse Proxy)"]
        direction TB
        ProxyServer["Proxy Server<br/>8000/TCP TLS 1.2+"]
        ChatHandler["Chat Completions Handler<br/>/v1/chat/completions"]
        CompHandler["Completions Handler<br/>/v1/completions"]
        HealthHandler["Health Check<br/>/health"]
        Passthrough["Catch-all Passthrough<br/>/ (all methods)"]
        NIXLv2["NIXL v2 Connector<br/>Two-phase P/D protocol"]
        LRUCache["LRU Proxy Cache<br/>16 entries, keyed by host:port"]

        subgraph SSRFProtection["SSRF Protection (optional)"]
            AllowlistValidator["AllowlistValidator<br/>Dynamic Informer"]
            Allowlist["Pod IP Allowlist<br/>Host-only validation"]
            AllowlistValidator -->|rebuilds on events| Allowlist
        end

        ProxyServer --> ChatHandler
        ProxyServer --> CompHandler
        ProxyServer --> HealthHandler
        ProxyServer --> Passthrough
        ChatHandler -->|validates target| Allowlist
        CompHandler -->|validates target| Allowlist
        ChatHandler -->|dispatches| NIXLv2
        CompHandler -->|dispatches| NIXLv2
        NIXLv2 -->|gets cached proxy| LRUCache
    end

    Client["Client / Inference Gateway"] -->|POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>x-prefiller-host-port header| ProxyServer

    InferencePoolCR["InferencePool CR<br/>(Gateway API Inference Extension)"] -->|watched by| AllowlistValidator
    Pods["Matching Pods"] -->|watched by| AllowlistValidator

    NIXLv2 -->|Phase 1: prefill request<br/>stream=false, max_tokens=1| RemotePrefiller["Remote vLLM Prefiller"]
    NIXLv2 -->|Phase 2: decode request<br/>with kv_transfer_params| LocalDecoder["Local vLLM Decoder<br/>default port 8001"]
    Passthrough -->|forwards directly| LocalDecoder

    style ProxyServer fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style ChatHandler fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style CompHandler fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style NIXLv2 fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style LRUCache fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style AllowlistValidator fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Allowlist fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style InferencePoolCR fill:#f5a623,color:#fff
    style RemotePrefiller fill:#7ed321
    style LocalDecoder fill:#7ed321
    style Client fill:#e8e8e8
    style Pods fill:#e8e8e8
